msgid ""
"Black solid circles representing the actual scores for each time point. You "
"can hover over the point to see the actual score value at that specific time "
"point along with the date on which the response was provided."
msgstr ""
"དུས་ཚོད་ཐིག་རེ་རེ་གི་དངོས་འགྲོ་འབྲས་བསྟན་པའི་ནག་པོ་གོར་གོར་ ཐིག་"
